$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM General/Typical Procedure: To 300 mg (1.14 mmol) of 1-a in 10 mL
N,N-di-methylformamide (DMF) were added 0.16 mL (1.14 mmol) of
N,N-diethylethylenediamine, 218 mg (1.14 mmol) of
N-(3-dimethylaminopropyl)-N'-ethylcarbodiimide hydrochloride (EDC), and
246 mg (1.82 mmol) of 1-hydroxybenzotriazole monohydrate (HOBt). The
reaction mixture was stirred at room temperature for two hours. The
solvent was removed in vacuo. To the residue was added saturated aqueous
sodium carbonate, and the product was extracted three times with
dichloromethane. The combined organic layers were dried over magnesium
sulphate, filtered and concentrated under reduced pressure. The product
was purified by column chromatography using methanol/dichloromethane
(5:95) mixture as eluent. To 340 mg (0.94 mmol) of 3-a in 10 mL methanol
was added catalytic amount of palladium on activated carbon. After
stirring under hydrogen gas atmosphere at room temperature for 30 min.,
the reaction mixture was filtered with aid of celite. Removal of solvent
under reduced pressure. To the 100 mg (0.3 mmol) of 3-b in 10 mL DMF were
added 62 mg (0.3 mmol) of 4-hexylbenzoic acid, 58 mg (0.3 mmol) of EDC,
and 65 mg (0.48 mmol) of HOBt. The reaction mixture was stirred at room
temperature for 2 h. After removal of solvent in vacuo, the residuewas
treated with saturated aqueous sodium carbonate and was extracted three
times with dichloromethane. The combined organic extracts were dried over
magnesium sulphate, filtered and concentrated under reduced pressure. The
product was purified by column chromatography using methanol/methylene
chloride (10: 90) mixture as eluent. Synthesis of
2,2,2-Trifluoro-N-[4-(4-methylpiperidin-1-yl)-3-(morpholine-4-carbonyl)-phenyl]-acetamide
(15). By the method A, the product was obtained in 3.3% overall yield in
3 steps from 1-a. 1H NMR (CDCl3, 400 MHz): δ 6.85 (s, 1H), 6.59 (d, J = 2
Hz, 2H), 3.87 (s, 1H), 3.79 (s, 1H), 3.69 (s, 4H), 3.49 (s, 1H), 3.28 (s,
2H), 3.15 (s, 1H), 2.92 (s, 1H), 2.80 (s, 1H), 2.36 (s, 1H), 1.73 (s,
1H), 1.60 (s, 1H), 1.41 (s, 1H), 1.23 (s, 1H), 0.95 (s, 3H).
