carbonate prior to attachment of the first amino acid, attachment to
resin in stage 1, FMOC deprotection with 20% piperidine in DMF, amino
acid coupling in presence of HBTU, DIEA in DMF at room temperature for 1
hour, monomer unstable on storage and producers linear peptide, other
products also detected
