5.21 (dq, J = 1.8, 6.6 Hz, 1 H), 5.04 - 4.90 (m, 2 H), 4.76 (dd, J = 1.9,
9.9 Hz, 1 H), 4.72 - 4.67 (m, 1 H), 4.62 (d, J = 13.6 Hz, 1 H), 4.44 (d,
J = 8.0 Hz, 1 H), 3.76 - 3.66 (m, 1 H), 3.61 (td, J = 8.3, 11.7 Hz, 1 H),
3.49 (td, J = 6.8, 11.4 Hz, 1 H), 3.34 (dt, J = 4.4, 7.7 Hz, 1 H), 3.08
(dd, J = 7.8, 13.3 Hz, 1 H), 2.90 (dd, J = 4.8, 13.3 Hz, 1 H), 2.66 -
2.55 (m, 2 H), 2.52 (dt, J = 3.6, 8.0 Hz, 1 H), 2.33 - 2.17 (m, 3 H),
2.04 - 1.87 (m, 6 H), 1.70 (d, J = 12.3 Hz, 1 H), 1.63 - 1.52 (m, 2 H),
