47.7, 47.2, 41.5, 38.9, 32.3, 31.5, 31.3, 31.2, 28.3, 25.6, 23.7, 22.9,
22.1, 22.0, 18.2, 14.2, 13.5. HRMS (FAB) Predicted for [C39H52F2N6O8 +
Na]+: 793.3712, Found: 793.3731.
