R.; Gerard, Baudouin; Kesavan, Sarathy; Lee, Maurice D.; Liu, Haibo;
Lowe, Jason T.; Marie, Jean-Charles; Mulrooney, Carol A.; Pandya, Bhaumik
A.; Rowley, Ann; Ryba, Troy D.; Suh, Byung-Chul; Wei, Jingqiang; Young,
Damian W.; Akella, Lakshmi B.; Ross, Nathan T.; Zhang, Yan-Ling; Fass,
Daniel M.; Reis, Surya A.; Zhao, Wen-Ning; Haggarty, Stephen J.; Palmer,
Michelle; Foley, Michael A.
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of the American Chemical Society (2010), 132(47), 16962-16976

