Mian; Wells, Lance; Pierce, Michael; Live, David H.; Boons, Geert-Jan
$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):REFERENCE(1):CITATION
$DATUM Journal of the American Chemical Society (2011), 133(36), 14418-14430

